      "content": "thanks for that. i was thinking more about the \"shifts in local demographic\" part. when you mention things like \"transient populations\" or changes in demographic makeup, how do those specific shifts usually correlate with risk in your analysis? like, are there certain types of cultural or community changes that are more predictive of a neighborhood's decline than others?",
